.SH "نام (NAME)"
labplot \- an application by KDE for interactive graphing and analysis of scientific data\&.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBlabplot\fR\ 'u
\fBlabplot\fR [\fILabPlot\ options\fR] [\fIfile\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
LabPlot is a data plotting and analysis tool\&.
.PP
Its features include 2D and 3D data and function plotting, easy editing of plots, analysis of data and functions, support for different worksheets using MDI and LabPlot project files\&.
.PP
Note that LabPlot is called using
\fBlabplot\fR\&.
.SH "LABPLOT OPTIONS"
.PP
For a full summary of generic options, run
\fB\fBlabplot\fR\fR\fB \fR\fB\fI\-\-help\fR\fR\&.
.PP
\fB\-\-no\-splash\fR
.RS 4
Do not show the splash screen\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-presenter\fR
.RS 4
Start in the presenter mode\&.
.RE
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
.PP
\fBfile\fR
.RS 4
The location of the project to be opened, usually ending with
\&.lml\&.
.sp
The project file can be also compressed, with its filename ending with
\&.lml\&.gz,
\&.lml\&.bz2
or
\&.lml\&.xz\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.RS 4
Full user documentation is available through the KDE Help Centre\&.
You can also enter the URL \m[blue]\fBhelp:/labplot\fR\m[]
(either enter this URL into Dolphin, or run
\fB\fBkhelpcenter\fR\fR\fB
\fR\fB\fIhelp:/labplot\fR\fR)\&.
.RE
.RS 4
kf5options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
qt5options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
There is also further information available at
\m[blue]\fBhttps://labplot\&.kde\&.org/\fR\m[]
.RE
